            { "gm.englishinput", new[]{ "进入游戏切英文一次", "Switch to English once at game entry" } },
            { "gm.englishinput.sub", new[]{ "默认关闭，可逐游戏覆盖。每次启动游戏仅向前台游戏尝试切换一次可用英文键盘布局；之后可随时切回中文，切出返回和退出不再切换。中途开启留到下次启动生效，重启 Pavise 不补切已运行的游戏。沿用系统布局共享方式；缺少英文布局或游戏不响应时跳过，不模拟按键、不改默认输入法。", "Off by default; supports per-game overrides. Requests an available English keyboard layout once for the foreground game. Switch back to Chinese freely; returning or exiting never switches again. Enabling mid-game applies next launch; restarting Pavise skips games already running. Respects Windows layout sharing. Missing layouts or unsupported games are skipped; no simulated keys or default-IME changes." } },
