            { "set.apppref.n", new[]{ "为选定的后台应用保存 Windows 节能显卡偏好，仅在确认同时存在核显与独显时可新增。下次启动应用生效，不迁移或重启正在运行的程序，不保证游戏独占独显。偏好持续保留；删除时只还原本工具的修改，保留用户后续更改。", "Save the Windows power-saving GPU preference for selected background apps. Adding requires a confirmed integrated and discrete GPU. Applies next launch; does not move or restart running apps or guarantee exclusive game GPU use. Preferences persist; removal restores only Pavise's changes and preserves later user changes." } },
            { "apppref.manage", new[]{ "管理应用", "Manage apps" } },
            { "apppref.nextlaunch", new[]{ "下次启动生效 · 不移动或重启正在运行的应用", "Applies next launch · Running apps are not moved or restarted" } },
            { "set.autogpu", new[]{ "自动后台节能显卡", "Auto power-saving GPU for background apps" } },
            { "set.autogpu.n", new[]{ "对局稳定后检测一次，将仍在游戏渲染卡上执行 3D 负载的后台程序登记为下次启动使用节能显卡。已有显卡偏好的程序、录屏与硬件工具、游戏库与白名单成员，以及带可见窗口的程序不在范围内。占用率取连续三轮采样的最小值，排除瞬时尖峰。每局最多登记 2 个，每个程序仅自动登记一次；在上方列表移除后不再自动加入。", "Checks once after the session stabilizes and enrolls background apps still running 3D work on the game's render GPU to use the power-saving GPU at their next launch. Out of scope: apps with an existing GPU preference, capture and hardware tools, library games, whitelisted apps, and any app with a visible window. Utilization is the minimum of three consecutive samples, which excludes momentary spikes. At most 2 apps per session, each enrolled only once; entries removed from the list above are not enrolled again." } },
            { "autogpu.warn", new[]{ "开启自动后台节能显卡？\r\n\r\n对局稳定约一分钟后检测一次，将仍在游戏渲染卡上执行 3D 负载的后台程序登记为下次启动使用节能显卡（写入 Windows 显卡偏好，不迁移也不重启正在运行的程序）。\r\n\r\n不在范围内：已设置显卡偏好的程序、录屏与通信覆盖层、硬件与外设工具、游戏库成员、白名单。每局最多登记 2 个，每个程序仅自动登记一次，可在「应用显卡偏好」列表中移除，移除后不再自动加入。\r\n\r\n影响：被登记的程序自下次启动起使用节能显卡，其渲染性能将下降。确认开启？", "Enable auto power-saving GPU for background apps?\r\n\r\nAbout a minute into a stable session, Pavise checks once and enrolls background apps still running 3D work on the game's render GPU to prefer the power-saving GPU at their next launch (a Windows GPU preference; running apps are neither moved nor restarted).\r\n\r\nOut of scope: apps with an existing GPU preference, capture and communication overlays, hardware and peripheral tools, library games, and whitelisted apps. At most 2 apps per session, each enrolled only once; entries can be removed in the Application GPU preferences list and are not enrolled again.\r\n\r\nImpact: enrolled apps render on the power-saving GPU from their next launch, which lowers their graphics performance. Continue?" } },
            { "apppref.browse", new[]{ "浏览 EXE", "Browse EXE" } },
            { "apppref.running", new[]{ "选择正在运行", "Choose running apps" } },
            { "apppref.remove", new[]{ "移除并还原", "Remove and restore" } },
            { "apppref.refresh", new[]{ "刷新", "Refresh" } },
            { "apppref.restoreall", new[]{ "还原全部偏好", "Restore all preferences" } },
            { "apppref.forget", new[]{ "仅移除记录", "Forget record only" } },
            { "apppref.exefilter", new[]{ "可执行程序 (*.exe)|*.exe", "Executable files (*.exe)|*.exe" } },
            { "apppref.add", new[]{ "添加偏好", "Add preferences" } },
            { "apppref.pick.title", new[]{ "选择后台应用", "Choose background apps" } },
            { "apppref.pick.sub", new[]{ "只设置所选应用的显卡偏好，下次启动生效，不移动正在运行的应用。", "Only selected apps are changed. Applies next launch; running apps are not moved." } },
            { "apppref.empty", new[]{ "列表为空。添加希望优先使用核显的后台应用。", "No apps listed. Add background apps that should prefer the integrated GPU." } },
            { "apppref.count", new[]{ "已记录 {0} 个应用 · 选择条目可移除并还原", "{0} apps listed · Select an entry to remove and restore it" } },
            { "apppref.added", new[]{ "已添加 {0} 个应用偏好，下次启动这些应用时生效。", "Added {0} app preferences. They apply when those apps next start." } },
            { "apppref.replace.confirm", new[]{ "{0} 已有 Windows 显卡设置（{1}）。\r\n{2}\r\n\r\n将保存原设置，并仅把显卡偏好改为“节能”。下次启动应用生效，删除条目时还原本工具的修改。确认替换？", "{0} already has a Windows graphics setting ({1}).\r\n{2}\r\n\r\nThe original will be saved and only its GPU preference changed to Power saving. Applies next launch. Removing the entry restores Pavise's changes. Replace it?" } },
            { "apppref.remove.confirm", new[]{ "移除 {0} 的偏好记录？\r\n\r\n只还原本工具实际改过的显卡偏好；原本就是节能或后来被用户修改的设置不动。正在运行的应用不会被重启。", "Remove the preference record for {0}?\r\n\r\nOnly the GPU preference actually changed by Pavise is restored. Existing power-saving settings and later user changes are preserved. Running apps are not restarted." } },
            { "apppref.restoreall.confirm", new[]{ "还原并移除本列表的全部偏好？\r\n\r\n只还原本工具的修改。原本就是节能或检测到外部修改时保留现状；无法确认归属的条目保留记录，需单独处理。", "Restore and remove every preference in this list?\r\n\r\nOnly Pavise's changes are restored. Existing power-saving settings and detected external changes are preserved. Entries with uncertain ownership retain their records for separate handling." } },
            { "apppref.forget.confirm", new[]{ "仅移除 {0} 的记录，并保留当前 Windows 显卡设置？\r\n\r\n此条目的修改归属无法确认。继续不会还原任何显卡偏好，也不会再自动恢复原值；请按需在 Windows 图形设置中手动调整。", "Forget only the record for {0}, leaving its current Windows graphics setting unchanged?\r\n\r\nOwnership cannot be confirmed. This will not restore a GPU preference, and its original value will no longer be restored automatically. Adjust it manually in Windows graphics settings if needed." } },
            { "apppref.done", new[]{ "操作已完成。显卡偏好在应用下次启动时读取。", "Done. GPU preferences are read when an app next starts." } },
            { "apppref.present", new[]{ "该应用已在列表中，未重复修改。", "This app is already listed; no duplicate change was made." } },
            { "apppref.needsconfirmation", new[]{ "此应用已有设置，需要确认后才能替换。", "This app has existing settings. Confirmation is required to replace them." } },
            { "apppref.unsupported", new[]{ "未确认同时存在核显与独显，不能新增；已有记录仍可还原。", "A confirmed integrated and discrete GPU pair was not found. Adding is disabled; existing entries can still be restored." } },
            { "apppref.invalidpath", new[]{ "请选择存在的 EXE 文件；不接受快捷方式或目录。", "Choose an existing EXE file, not a shortcut or directory." } },
            { "apppref.changed", new[]{ "设置在操作期间发生变化。已停止覆盖，请刷新后确认。", "Settings changed during the operation. Overwriting was stopped; refresh and review." } },
            { "apppref.busy", new[]{ "显卡偏好正在处理，或待命预选记录尚未确认还原，请稍后重试。", "GPU preferences are busy, or a standby staging record has not been safely restored. Retry later." } },
            { "apppref.readfailed", new[]{ "无法读取当前显卡偏好，未继续修改。", "Current GPU preferences could not be read. No further change was attempted." } },
            { "apppref.writefailed", new[]{ "无法确认偏好写入结果，恢复记录已保留，请刷新检查。", "The preference write could not be confirmed. Recovery records were retained; refresh to review." } },
            { "apppref.journalfailed", new[]{ "恢复记录无法安全读写，操作未完成。请保留配置，不要直接删除记录。", "Recovery records could not be safely read or written. The operation is incomplete; keep the configuration and records." } },
            { "apppref.notfound", new[]{ "条目已不存在，请刷新列表。", "This entry no longer exists. Refresh the list." } },
            { "apppref.pending", new[]{ "部分还原未完成，记录已保留。可重试；仅在决定保留当前 Windows 设置时选择“仅移除记录”。", "Some restoration is incomplete; records were retained. Retry, or choose Forget record only if you want to keep the current Windows settings." } },
