            { "store.savefatal.title", new[]{ "配置不兼容或读写失败", "Incompatible configuration or read/write failure" } },
            { "store.savefatal.body", new[]{ "旧配置与当前版本不兼容，或游戏库无法正常读写。\r\n\r\n系统改动已还原，旧配置、日志与注册表设置已自动清除：\r\n{0}\r\n\r\n程序将退出，请重新启动。", "The old configuration is incompatible with this version, or the game library could not be read or written.\r\n\r\nSystem changes were restored. Old configuration, logs and registry settings were automatically cleared:\r\n{0}\r\n\r\nThe app will exit. Please restart it." } },
            { "store.savefatal.deletefail", new[]{ "旧配置与当前版本不兼容，或游戏库无法正常读写，未能安全完成重置：\r\n{0}\r\n\r\n{1}\r\n\r\n程序将退出。请保留剩余配置并重新启动以重试还原；文件被占用时先关闭占用程序。不要手动删除尚未还原的恢复记录。", "The old configuration is incompatible with this version, or the game library could not be read or written. Reset could not safely complete:\r\n{0}\r\n\r\n{1}\r\n\r\nThe app will exit. Keep remaining configuration and restart to retry restoration. Close any program holding the files. Do not manually delete pending recovery records." } },
