            { "v20.advanced.warn.title", new[]{ "进入高级", "Enter Advanced" } },
            { "v20.advanced.warn.body", new[]{ "日常游戏使用预设模式已完全够用，无需额外进入高级区。\r\n\r\n这里的选项会直接改变系统、驱动和硬件相关行为，不是常规设置。\r\n\r\n如果你是电脑新手，或者不清楚每个选项的具体作用，请不要继续。误调可能导致性能下降、游戏异常，或需要重启才能恢复。\r\n\r\n仍要进入高级区吗？", "For everyday gaming, the preset modes are already sufficient; there is no need to adjust anything in the Advanced area.\r\n\r\nThese controls directly change system, driver, and hardware behavior; they are not ordinary settings.\r\n\r\nIf you are new to PC tuning or do not understand exactly what each option does, do not continue. Incorrect changes may reduce performance, cause game problems, or require a restart to recover.\r\n\r\nEnter Advanced anyway?" } },
