            { "v15.library.force.confirm", new[]{ "强制接管 {0}？\r\n\r\n进程存在即保持游戏模式。仅用于手动启停的程序，勿选常驻进程。", "Force takeover for {0}?\r\n\r\nGame mode stays active while it runs. Use only for manually controlled programs, never resident ones." } },
