            { "lib.rebar.warn", new[]{ "ReBAR 强开不一定适合所有游戏。部分游戏开启后可能掉帧、卡顿或出现画面异常。\n\n建议按游戏单独测试，出现问题时关闭。正在运行的游戏可能需要重启后才生效。\n\n是否为当前游戏开启？", "Forcing ReBAR is not suitable for every game. Some games may lose frame rate, stutter, or show visual glitches.\n\nTest it for each game and turn it off if problems occur. A running game may need to be restarted for the change to take effect.\n\nEnable it for this game?" } },
