            { "lib.rebar.bios", new[]{ "未检测到 NVIDIA 显卡的大容量显存映射，ReBAR 可能尚未在 BIOS 中开启，或硬件不支持。\n\n请在 BIOS 中确认 Resizable BAR 与 Above 4G Decoding 已开启，重启后再试。Pavise 无法代替 BIOS 开启此功能。\n\n本次未开启，游戏设置保持关闭。", "No large memory aperture was detected on the NVIDIA GPU. ReBAR may be disabled in BIOS or unsupported by the hardware.\n\nCheck Resizable BAR and Above 4G Decoding in BIOS, restart, then try again. Pavise cannot enable the BIOS feature.\n\nThe game setting remains off." } },
            { "lib.rebar.unknown", new[]{ "无法确认 NVIDIA 显卡的 ReBAR 硬件状态，因此本次未开启。\n\n请先在 NVIDIA 控制面板的系统信息中确认 Resizable BAR 为“是”，并检查显卡驱动。检测失败不代表 BIOS 一定未开启。", "The NVIDIA GPU's ReBAR hardware state could not be verified. The setting remains off.\n\nCheck that Resizable BAR reads Yes in NVIDIA Control Panel > System Information, and check the graphics driver. A failed detection does not prove it is disabled in BIOS." } },
            { "lib.rebar.driver", new[]{ "未检测到可用的 NVIDIA 驱动接口。此开关用于 NVIDIA 游戏驱动配置，不能用于 AMD 或 Intel 显卡。\n\n本次未开启；如使用 NVIDIA 显卡，请检查驱动安装。", "No available NVIDIA driver interface was detected. This switch configures NVIDIA game profiles, not AMD or Intel GPUs.\n\nThe setting remains off. If you use an NVIDIA GPU, check the driver installation." } },
            { "lib.rebar.tip", new[]{ "仅对本游戏请求 NVIDIA ReBAR 强制开启；默认关闭。需兼容的 NVIDIA 显卡、驱动及 BIOS 已开启 ReBAR，不能代替 BIOS 开启。开关表示个人选择，不代表已生效或必然增帧。运行中更改后可能需要重启游戏；关闭或退局还原 Pavise 写入的驱动项。", "Request NVIDIA ReBAR for this game only; off by default. Requires compatible NVIDIA hardware and driver, with ReBAR enabled in BIOS. This switch records your preference, not verified activation or an FPS gain. Changes may require restarting the game. Turning off or ending the session restores driver settings owned by Pavise." } },
