            { "set.laptopperf", new[]{ "笔记本厂商性能模式", "Laptop vendor performance mode" } },
            { "set.laptopperf.n", new[]{ "默认关闭。开启后，接通电源时在支持的联想、华硕机型上进游戏切换性能档，退出或关闭时恢复原档位。电源计划选择“不切换”时暂停接管。可能增加风扇噪声与功耗。", "Off by default. On supported Lenovo and ASUS laptops, switch to the vendor performance mode during games while plugged in, then restore the previous mode on exit or disable. Paused when Don't switch is selected for the power plan. May increase fan noise and power use." } },
            { "set.laptopperf.fail", new[]{ "性能模式设置保存失败，请重试。", "Could not save the performance mode preference. Please try again." } },
            { "set.autolayout", new[]{ "后台核心自动避让", "Automatic background core placement" } },
            { "set.autolayout.n", new[]{ "全局设置，默认关闭，所有模式均可开启。游戏期间只调整符合压制条件的后台核心分配，游戏仍保留完整核心范围。逐游戏手动方案优先；少核心与不支持的结构保留系统调度。退出或关闭时恢复。", "Global setting, off by default and available in every mode. During games, adjust only eligible suppressed background apps' core placement; the game keeps its full core range. Manual game plans take priority. Small or unsupported layouts keep system scheduling. Restore on exit or disable." } },
