            { "linkmetric.wireless", new[]{ "有线口带网关且已连通，但默认路由落在无线口。Wi-Fi 6E 和 7 的自动跃点与千兆有线打平。修复把有线口跃点设为 5", "The wired adapter has a gateway and is up, yet the default route sits on wireless: the automatic metric of Wi-Fi 6E/7 ties with gigabit wired. The repair sets the wired metric to 5" } },
