            { "gm.pausesvc", new[]{ "暂停非必要系统服务", "Pause nonessential system services" } },
            { "gm.pausesvc.sub", new[]{ "对局中尝试暂停打印、索引、地图下载、媒体共享等指定服务，对应功能暂不可用；有打印任务、打印共享或依赖在用时跳过。退场仅恢复本次由 Pavise 暂停的服务，原本停止或禁用的不动。", "May pause print, indexing, map download and media sharing services during play; features stop. Skips busy or shared printing and services with active dependents. On exit, resumes only services Pavise paused; already stopped or disabled ones stay untouched." } },
            { "standbycleaner.switch.savefailed", new[]{ "开关设置未能保存，本次未启动或已停止清理，请检查配置写入权限。", "Could not save the switch. Cleanup was not started or has been stopped for this run. Check settings write access." } },
            { "gm.standbycleaner", new[]{ "待机内存清理", "Standby memory cleanup" } },
            { "gm.standbycleaner.sub", new[]{ "手动开启后，仅在对局中、缓存列表和空闲内存同时满足阈值时清理待机缓存；两次清理至少间隔约一分钟。可能引起瞬时卡顿和重新读盘。模式切换不改变开关，不联动计时器或内存压缩。", "When enabled manually, purges standby cache during a match only when both cache-list and free-memory thresholds pass, at least about a minute apart. May cause a hitch and disk re-reads. Independent of mode, timer and memory-compression settings." } },
            { "gm.standbycleaner.cfgsub", new[]{ "只覆盖此游戏的开关，开启优先于全局关闭；参数在“优化策略 → 会话附加”统一设置。对局中满足双阈值才清理待机缓存；清理瞬间会卡顿一下，两次清理至少间隔约一分钟。", "For this game only; On overrides global Off. Shared parameters are in Optimization policy → Session extras. During play, both thresholds must pass; the purge itself stutters the game briefly, and purges are at least about a minute apart." } },
            { "gm.standbycleaner.needadmin", new[]{ "开启待机内存清理需要管理员权限；已开启时仍可关闭。参数可以先保存，不会自动开启。", "Administrator rights are required to enable standby cleanup. An existing opt-in can still be turned off. Saving parameters does not enable it." } },
            { "standbycleaner.warn", new[]{ "开启待机内存清理？\r\n\r\n仅在对局中、两项内存阈值同时满足时清空系统待机缓存。清理调用不可中断，可能引起瞬时卡顿，缓存随后可能需要重新读盘，不保证提升性能。两次清理至少间隔约一分钟。\r\n\r\n由环境页开关控制，模式切换不改变选择；参数可通过「设置参数」调整。", "Enable standby memory cleanup?\r\n\r\nPurges system standby cache during matches only when both memory thresholds pass. The call cannot be interrupted and may cause a hitch and later disk re-reads; performance gains are not guaranteed. Purges are at least about a minute apart.\r\n\r\nControlled by the Environment switch, independently of mode. Use Parameters to adjust thresholds." } },
            { "standbycleaner.config.invalid", new[]{ "待机清理参数损坏，已停止清理。请先在“设置参数”核对并保存，再手动开启；已显示开启的项目需先关闭再开。", "Parameters are invalid; cleanup has stopped. Review and save Parameters, then enable cleanup manually. If a switch already shows On, turn it off and on again." } },
            { "standbycleaner.options", new[]{ "设置参数", "Parameters" } },
            { "standbycleaner.options.title", new[]{ "待机内存清理参数", "Standby cleanup parameters" } },
            { "standbycleaner.options.hint", new[]{ "参数对所有游戏共享。保存不会开启功能，也不会立即清理。\r\n仅在对局中且开关开启时检查；两项阈值必须同时满足（且）：", "Parameters are shared across games. Saving does not enable or immediately run cleanup.\r\nChecks only during play while enabled; BOTH conditions must be met (AND):" } },
            { "standbycleaner.options.repair", new[]{ "原参数损坏，下面暂以 Pavise 默认值预填，尚未写入。请核对后保存；之后仍需手动关闭并重新开启待机清理。", "The stored parameters are invalid. Pavise defaults are shown below but have not been saved. Review and save them, then turn standby cleanup off and on manually." } },
            { "standbycleaner.options.list", new[]{ "缓存列表 ≥（MB）", "Cache list >= (MB)" } },
            { "standbycleaner.options.list.sub", new[]{ "列表 = 待机缓存 + 系统工作集（SystemCache），不是仅待机缓存。", "List = standby cache + system working set (SystemCache), not standby alone." } },
            { "standbycleaner.options.free", new[]{ "空闲内存 <（MB）", "Free memory < (MB)" } },
            { "standbycleaner.options.free.sub", new[]{ "空闲 = 空闲页 + 零页，不含待机缓存；不是任务管理器中的“可用”。", "Free = free + zeroed pages, excluding standby; this is not Task Manager's Available value." } },
            { "standbycleaner.options.poll", new[]{ "检查间隔（毫秒）", "Check interval (ms)" } },
            { "standbycleaner.options.poll.sub", new[]{ "间隔越短，检查越频繁；不会调整系统计时器精度。", "A shorter interval checks more often; it does not change system timer resolution." } },
            { "standbycleaner.options.units", new[]{ "MB 按 1,048,576 字节计算。两项阈值范围 0–1,048,576 MB；间隔范围 250–300,000 毫秒。成功清理一次后至少冷却约一分钟（不少于 8 个检查间隔）才会再次清理。", "MB means 1,048,576 bytes. Both thresholds accept 0–1,048,576 MB; the interval accepts 250–300,000 ms. After a successful purge, cleanup cools down for at least about a minute (no less than eight intervals) before purging again." } },
