            { "env.dvr.manual", new[]{ "开启后，守护期间关闭 Windows Game DVR / Xbox 游戏录制与后台捕获，期间即时回放和录制热键不可用。\n关闭此开关、停止守护或退出 Pavise 时恢复原设置；所有模式共用此选择。\nGame Bar 录屏进程默认免于后台压制。需要录屏时，请关闭此开关。", "Disables Windows Game DVR / Xbox game recording and background capture while the guard is on, including instant replay and recording hotkeys.\nRestores the original settings when this switch or the guard is turned off, or when Pavise exits. All modes share this choice.\nGame Bar recording processes are protected from background suppression by default. Turn this switch off to use recording." } },
