            { "env.windowed.n", new[]{ "适用于 Windows 11 22H2 及以上的兼容 DX10 / DX11 窗口或无边框游戏。更改后需重启游戏。\n保持系统原有开启状态；由 Pavise 开启的设置可通过关闭开关还原。", "For compatible DX10 / DX11 windowed or borderless games on Windows 11 22H2 or later. Restart the game after changes.\nExisting system settings are preserved. Turn this off to restore changes made by Pavise." } },
            { "env.vrr", new[]{ "Windows 可变刷新率优化", "Windows variable refresh rate optimization" } },
            { "env.vrr.n", new[]{ "为部分未原生支持 VRR 的 DX11 全屏游戏提供支持，需要兼容的显示器和驱动；不替代 FreeSync / G-SYNC 的驱动开关。\n更改后重启游戏。由 Pavise 开启的设置可关闭还原。", "Adds VRR support for some DX11 fullscreen games without native support. Requires a compatible display and driver; does not replace driver FreeSync / G-SYNC settings.\nRestart the game after changes. Turn this off to restore changes made by Pavise." } },
