            { "env.timertick.manual", new[]{ "手动配置时钟与节拍启动参数，开关后需重启电脑。切换模式不改动此设置；关闭时恢复原配置。", "Manually configures clock and tick boot parameters; restart Windows after changing it. Mode changes leave this setting alone; switching off restores the original configuration." } },
            { "env.gtimer.manual", new[]{ "开启或还原配置后需重启电脑。仅在对局中请求 0.5 ms，退局释放；实际精度由系统决定，可能增加功耗。", "Restart Windows after enabling or restoring this configuration. Requests 0.5 ms during matches and releases it afterwards; actual resolution depends on Windows. May increase power use." } },
            { "env.cachewarm.manual", new[]{ "手动开启后，仅在游戏待命且桌面空闲时低优先级预读；进入对局或关闭开关立即取消。仅交流供电、内存充足且游戏位于固态盘时运行，不保证提升帧率。", "When enabled manually, pre-reads at low priority only while a game is armed and the desktop is idle. Cancels on match start or when switched off. Requires AC power, ample memory and an SSD; no FPS gain is guaranteed." } },
